<doc id="31190" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=31190" title="Sean Connery">
Sean Connery

Sir Thomas Séan Connery (babar &lt;a href="25%20Agustus"&gt;25 Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1930"&gt;1930&lt;/a&gt; di kota &lt;a href="Edinburgh"&gt;Edinburgh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Skotlandia"&gt;Skotlandia&lt;/a&gt; - 2020, leuwih terkenal ku sebatan Séan Connery) mangrupa saorang aktor film jeung TV asal ti Skotlandia, Britania Raya. Anjeunna terkenal sabagai pameran &lt;a href="James%20Bond"&gt;James Bond&lt;/a&gt; pertama. Sampai ka kiwari, Connery parantos maen dina tujuh film James Bond, dimimitian dina &lt;a href="Dr.%20No%20%28film%29"&gt;Dr. No&lt;/a&gt; taun 1962 dan diahiri dina &lt;a href="Never%20Say%20Never%20Again"&gt;Never Say Never Again&lt;/a&gt; taun 1983.
Di luar James Bond, Connnery mangrupa saorang aktor handal. Anjeunna parantos meunang macam-macam panghargaan sapertos &lt;a href="Academy%20Award"&gt;Academy Award&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Golden%20Globe"&gt;Golden Globe&lt;/a&gt;, jeung &lt;a href="BAFTA%20Award"&gt;BAFTA Award&lt;/a&gt;. Sasih Juli 2000, Connery ngadapetkeun gelar ksatria kahormatan ti Ratu Elizabeth II.
