<doc id="31191" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=31191" title="George Lazenby">
George Lazenby

Géorge Robert Lazenby (babar &lt;a href="5%20September"&gt;5 September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1939"&gt;1939&lt;/a&gt; di &lt;a href="Queanbeyan"&gt;Queanbeyan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20South%20Wales"&gt;New South Wales&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;) mangrupa saorang aktor film sareng tilas modél asal Australia. Anjeunna terkenal sabagai salah sahiji pameran resmi &lt;a href="James%20Bond"&gt;James Bond&lt;/a&gt;, tepatnya dina film &lt;a href="On%20Her%20Majesty%27s%20Secret%20Service%20%28film%29"&gt;On Her Majesty's Service&lt;/a&gt; di taun 1969.
Sampai ka kiwari, Lazenby janten hiji-hijina aktor James Bond anu asalna sanes ti &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;Britania Raya&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Skotlandia"&gt;Skotlandia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wales"&gt;Wales&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Irlandia%20Utara"&gt;Irlandia Utara&lt;/a&gt;, termasuk ogé &lt;a href="Republik%20Irlandia"&gt;Republik Irlandia&lt;/a&gt;). Salian dina film James Bond, Lazenby ogé muncul dina film-film laga anu dibintangan ku aktor &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bruce%20Lee"&gt;Bruce Lee&lt;/a&gt; sareng &lt;a href="Raymond%20Chow"&gt;Raymond Chow&lt;/a&gt;.
