Timothy Peter Dalton (alias Timothy Dalton, akrab ku sebatan Timmy, babar di &lt;a href="Colwyn%20Bay"&gt;Colwyn Bay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wales"&gt;Wales&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Britania%20Raya"&gt;UK&lt;/a&gt; kaping &lt;a href="21%20Maret"&gt;21 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1946"&gt;1946&lt;/a&gt;) mangrupa saorang aktor film asal Wales. Anjeunna dikenal sabagai salah sahiji aktor resmi film James Bond dina &lt;a href="The%20Living%20Daylights"&gt;The Living Daylights&lt;/a&gt; (1987) jeung &lt;a href="Licence%20to%20Kill"&gt;Licence to Kill&lt;/a&gt; (1989). Anjeunna ogé terkenal ku peranna dia sababaraha hiji seri film sareng seri drama téater &lt;a href="William%20Shakespeare"&gt;Shakespearean&lt;/a&gt;.
